{"title":"Troll Pitkeeper","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 28 Troll that attacks with crush (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">crush</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">slash</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      \n      \n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/troll-heart\">Troll Heart</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. About 1 kill in 500, 1 in 50 from an elite. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/troll-pitkeeper\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/troll-pitkeeper?lv=28\">Lv 28</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/troll-pitkeeper?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>8</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/troll-pitkeeper?lv=28\" title=\"Pick level 28\"><td><b>28</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>106</td><td>19.9</td><td>1,400</td><td class=\"muted\">318 · 27.9 · 4,200</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/troll-pitkeeper?lv=44\" title=\"Pick level 44\"><td><b>44</b></td><td>233</td><td>28.7</td><td>2,200</td><td class=\"muted\">699 · 40.2 · 6,600</td><td>8</td><td><span class=\"muted\">—</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 1 looted corpse recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - 2 recorded drops, 471 total, 179–292 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×179–292</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ogrewax-legs\" title=\"Ogrewax Legs - in 1 of 1 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/661962eb273d384bc5cd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogrewax Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1<br>×1</span><span class=\"entity-chip-quality\">Excellent: 1 of 1</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses whose loot was recorded; kills nobody looted are not counted), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Kragmaw&#39;s Court</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 8</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"5901\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><p class=\"muted\">No sightings yet.</p>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/gnashtooth-the-pitkeeper\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/9f005bb4451c0e6cc365.svg\" alt=\"\"><b>Gnashtooth the Pitkeeper</b><span>Lv 44</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Troll: <a href=\"#/monster/troll\">Troll</a> <span class=\"muted\">(17)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/redrock-troll\">Redrock Troll</a> <span class=\"muted\">(27)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/chalk-troll\">Chalk Troll</a> <span class=\"muted\">(28)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/troll-shaman\">Troll Shaman</a> <span class=\"muted\">(30)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/troll-glutton\">Troll Glutton</a> <span class=\"muted\">(31)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/barrow-troll\">Barrow Troll</a> <span class=\"muted\">(32)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/troll-king\">Troll King</a> <span class=\"muted\">(33)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/gen/b2ee0b5efdf05ce0cfbe.svg\" alt=\"Troll Pitkeeper\"></div><h3>Troll Pitkeeper</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>28 <span class=\"muted\">(seen 44–44)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Troll</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>crush · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>106</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>19.9</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>1400</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>5.3 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>Yes</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>1 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}